  "outstanding": [
    "The individual fixed-length factorization uses cocompactness and a local mass theorem. The argument applies normalized Gram-fibre existence, uniqueness and disintegration, adelic Haar product formulas, the Hermitian classification supplied from a quadratic Hasse norm theorem, and the separate positive-volume counting result. The scalar example evaluates only the transport factors."
